<h1>Moments</h1>
<p>The Moments feature lets you record gifts and memories for special occasions.</p>
<img src="/assets/images/agemap/en/screenshot-moments.png" alt="Moments Screen" class="app-screenshot">

<h2>Adding a Moment</h2>
<ol>
  <li>Tap a person on AgeMap to open their details.</li>
  <li>In the Moments section, tap <strong>Add</strong>.</li>
  <li>Enter the following information:
    <ul>
      <li>Year</li>
      <li>Title (e.g., Birthday Gift, Christmas)</li>
      <li>Memo</li>
      <li>Direction — <strong>Given</strong> or <strong>Received</strong></li>
      <li>Icon — 🎁 Gift, 💰 Cash, ❤️ Heart, 🎂 Cake, 💌 Letter, etc.</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
  <li>You can attach a photo.</li>
</ol>

<h2>Viewing Moments</h2>
<p>View moment records organized by year in the person's detail screen.</p>
<ul>
  <li>Given and received items are displayed separately.</li>
  <li>Records with attached photos are shown with their images.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Editing/Deleting Moments</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Tap a recorded moment to edit its title, memo, photo, icon, etc.</li>
  <li>Records that are no longer needed can be deleted.</li>
</ul>

</div>
